<title>FRANCE: French cocoa bean imports in August.</title>
<headline>French cocoa bean imports in August.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French August cocoa bean imports issued by French customs included. (in tonnes).</p>
<p>		 August 96   August 95     Jan/Aug 96  Jan/Aug 95</p>
<p>Ivory Coast    4,039	4,402	   45,967	46,329</p>
<p>Ghana		320	  253	   10,321	 9,039</p>
<p>Nigeria	  1,143	  718	    8,468	 2,825</p>
<p>Cameroon	   796	1,001	    7,284	 6,810</p>
<p>Indonesia	  756	  646	    7,404	 7,616</p>
<p>World total    7,438	7,625	   84,175	78,364</p>
</text>
